# Compact liquid-water grid for the DISORT-options investigation (near-backscatter geometries)
# (validation/v24/disort_options/run_variant.py).  Not a production grid:
# every value is a node of liquid-water-cloud-grid-b.lut.
6 uneven_logarithmic # optical depth
0.25 1.0 4.0 16.0 64.0 256.0
5 uneven_linear # physical effective radius, microns
3.0 7.0 15.0 25.0 35.0
2 uneven_linear # solar zenith, degrees
30.0 33.75
2 uneven_linear # satellite zenith, degrees
30.0 33.75
37 linear # relative azimuth, degrees, 0-180 (Grid B; the generator needs a grid symmetric about 90)
0 180
